7
00:00:21,083 --> 00:00:22,550
Ooh, I feel like Emily!

8
00:00:22,650 --> 00:00:25,252
Suddenly, I want to win over
that mean head of marketing.

9
00:00:26,053 --> 00:00:27,320
Just one question.

10
00:00:27,420 --> 00:00:30,088
