38
00:01:52,570 --> 00:01:54,938
Listen, if it were my wedding,
I'd be like,

39
00:01:55,039 --> 00:01:58,975
(French accent): Oh-ho-ho.
Bastille Day, oui, oui.

40
00:02:00,109 --> 00:02:03,143
